# game/src/plot/+tutor.rpy:46
translate chinese tutor_hud_ffa09f64:

    # tutor "As in life, some activities are only available on specific days of the week. A good example of this is classes, which only take place Monday through Friday."
    tutor "就像在生活中一样，有些活动只在特定日期可用。一个很好的例子是课程，只在周一至周五进行。"

# game/src/plot/+tutor.rpy:47
translate chinese tutor_hud_300a2a92:

    # tutor "Advancing between days is done by sleeping, which can be triggered by interacting with [saga.cast.anon]'s bed. Sometimes it may also be desirable to use the chair to ensure a peaceful night's sleep."
    tutor "通过睡觉来推进天数，这可以通过与[saga.cast.anon]的床互动来触发。有时也可能需要使用椅子来确保一夜安眠。"

# game/src/plot/+tutor.rpy:61
translate chinese tutor_hud_12d126ef:

    # nvl clear
    # tutor "The map icon is used to display the town map, which can be used to travel to other locations in Summerville."
    nvl clear
    tutor "地图图标用于显示城镇地图，可用来在夏日镇的其他地点之间旅行。"

# game/src/plot/+tutor.rpy:64
translate chinese tutor_hud_e7008724:

    # tutor "While the map is always available, sometimes it will not be possible to travel due to an active quest."
    tutor "尽管地图随时可用，但有时由于正在进行中的任务，旅行可能无法进行。"

# game/src/plot/+tutor.rpy:65
translate chinese tutor_hud_a57f20f1:

    # tutor "Travelling is not teleporting and may be interrupted by an event taking place en route."
    tutor "旅行并非瞬间传送，可能会被途中发生的事件打断。"

# game/src/plot/+tutor.rpy:78
translate chinese tutor_hud_dead2801:

    # nvl clear
    # tutor "Clicking the satchel icon accesses the inventory. It contains any items collected around town, along with their names and descriptions."
    nvl clear
    tutor "点击背包图标可进入物品栏。其中包含在镇上收集的所有物品，以及它们的名称和描述。"

# game/src/plot/+tutor.rpy:81
translate chinese tutor_hud_5cdba178:

    # tutor "Some items can be further inspected, or in rare cases used directly from the inventory. Worth keeping in mind if you find yourself struggling with a quest involving special items."
    tutor "有些物品可以进一步检查，或在极少数情况下直接从物品栏中使用。如果你发现自己被困在涉及特殊物品的任务中，这一点值得牢记。"

# game/src/plot/+tutor.rpy:94
translate chinese tutor_hud_a1690f6a:

    # nvl clear
    # tutor "The phone contains a multitude of in-game functionality, including text messages, statistics, and quest hints."
    nvl clear
    tutor "手机包含多种游戏内功能，包括短信、统计数据和任务提示。"

# game/src/plot/+tutor.rpy:105
translate chinese tutor_hud_64dceacd:

    # nvl clear
    # tutor "This display shows the cash currently on hand."
    nvl clear
    tutor "此显示区域显示当前持有的现金。"

# game/src/plot/+tutor.rpy:108
translate chinese tutor_hud_5166f5b2:

